## Trace luồng xử lý CHÍNH XÁC từ JSON

### Luồng chính (Schedule path)

```
Schedule Trigger → Read Posts Schedule → Filter Pending → Split Posts Batch
  ├── Done (output 0) → (kết thúc)
  └── Item (output 1) → Parse Media & Groups → Read Groups Config → Combine Post + Groups Data → Loop Over Groups
        ├── Done (output 0) → Mark Post Completed → quay lại Split Posts Batch
        └── Item (output 1) → Route By Post Type
              ├── Group (output 0) → [NHÁNH GROUP]
              └── Page (output 1)  → [NHÁNH PAGE]
```

---

### NHÁNH GROUP — Trace từng connection

```
Route By Post Type (Group)
  → Prepare Group Media Items
    → Split Group Media Batch
        ├── Done (output 0) → Wait Before Next Group → Loop Over Groups
        └── Item (output 1) → Get File Path from Telegram
              → Format Media URL
                → Upload Media to Facebook (published=false)
                  → Wait After Upload (2s)
                    → Post to Group (mediaIds = 1 ảnh)
                      → Build Post URL
                        → Log Success
                          → Notify Success (Telegram)
                            → quay lại Split Group Media Batch
```

### NHÁNH PAGE — Trace từng connection

```
Route By Post Type (Page)
  → Prepare Page Media Items
    → Split Page Media Batch
        ├── Done (output 0) → Wait Before Next Group → Loop Over Groups
        └── Item (output 1) → Get File Path from Telegram (Page)
              → Format Media URL (Page)
                → Upload Media to Facebook (Page) (published=false)
                  → Wait After Upload (Page) (2s)
                    → Post to Page (mediaIds = 1 ảnh)
                      → Build Post URL (Page)
                        → Log Success Page
                          → Notify Success Page (Telegram)
                            → quay lại Split Page Media Batch
```

